---
import Layout from "../layouts/layout.astro";
import { siteInfo } from "../data/siteInfo.js";
---

<Layout title="About the East SMP">


<a class="discord-button" href="https://discord.gg/uSeBnAh5Px" target="_blank">
	Join Discord
</a>



<div class="page-content">


<h1>
	About the East SMP
</h1>



<div class="page-info">

<p>
	Website Version: <b>{siteInfo.version}</b><br>
	Last Updated: {siteInfo.lastUpdated}
</p>

</div>





<section>

<p>
	The East SMP is a scripted Minecraft SMP where we make videos with not only our creators, but also members of the East community.
</p>


<p>
	When we make a video, we will ask you first if you want to be included.
</p>


<p>
	If you don't want to make videos, you can still be part of our videos because the SMP is scripted and we need players to help bring the story to life.
</p>


<p>
	If you want to become a trusted member of our community, let us know through the Discord form.
</p>


<p>
	Currently, we have two protagonists. If you want to become one too, you can apply using the form.
</p>


<p>
	We also have trusted members, and we still have more slots available.
</p>


<p>
	We hope you join and have fun on the East SMP!
</p>

</section>





<!-- Suggestions/issues -->

<div id="suggestion-area">

</div>





<!-- Server Status -->

<div class="status-container">


<div id="status-box" class="status-box">


<h3>
	Server Status
</h3>


<p id="server-status">
	Checking...
</p>


<p id="player-count"></p>


</div>





</div>





</div>


</Layout>